Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,o ISBN Pierre
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the sea where my father\Nis, the future Bonnie chooses!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.02,0:01:39.32,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(960,980)}{\fad(200,1500)}"To the Sea Where My Father is!\NThe Future Bonney Chooses"{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.87,0:01:51.58,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1344,360)}{\fad(880,0)}Three \NYears Ago, \NMt. Corvo,\NGoa Kingdom, \NEast Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.90,0:02:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how'd you like that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not going\Nto use it on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With moves like these, no\None in the world can beat me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.67,0:02:35.63,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(967.333,776)}{\fad(340,0)}Monkey D. Luffy (Age 16)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I could even take ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem rather familiar\Nwith this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you go to that village\Non its outskirts to see someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:03:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were watching that boy, but\Nyou never said a word to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep talking and it'll be the death of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A child is every parent's weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my special move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can stand up to that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll save it for when I gotta\Nfight someone really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm a pirate, I'm going\Nto have a crew, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one of them might get beaten\Nup and captured by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll say, not so fast, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody messes with my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come go, battle axe. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's OK, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't eat cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was weird. I felt something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gave me a chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some wild animal must be king\Nof the mountain here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates attacked a merchant ship and fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chase them down while they're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the merchants who were\Nraided by pirates just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They showed up out of\Nnowhere and took our cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And can you take care of the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks bad, but we can\Nhandle it, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that. Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll transport him to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and move, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chase down that pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have your cargo back\Nby the time you catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be on our way soon. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Bartholomew Goomba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrender immediately. Aye aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab the cargo and bring\Nit in before he kills us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Bonnie...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's beauty can't be captured by\Ndrawings or photos and encyclopedias.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's brimming with exquisite scenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to watch your\Nface light up when you see it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1592,534)}{\fad(600,0)}Sorbet Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your dad is just busy traveling,\Nor maybe the news coup got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he said he'd write me, and\NI haven't gotten one letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more you want them,\Nthe slower time will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll come soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put this in the mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another letter came today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many are we up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been sending her\Nabout 10 letters a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been dozens by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can one idiot have\Nso much to write about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Bonney, though I've said\Nit countless times, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Pert, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Bonney?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, want to play Jango? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie, turn back to normal. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to take your medicine, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so lucky to have a\Nhard-working nurse like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care for a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I seeing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie looked like some\Nsort of hulking brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's all better! I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, sweetie, but it's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's just a bitter placebo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused, Connie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to keep Bonnie's\Npowers a secret from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better to be safe, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, haven't you heard that\Na wise wolf hides its fangs?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.33,0:09:36.76,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1568,682)}{\fad(850,550)}Marines' Science \NGroup, Laboratory 8
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's incredible, doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's complete already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, all that's left is to lift my\Nlab and my brain with island clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the buildings you\Nsee here are holograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had intended to do this on Punk\NHazard originally, like the head cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I feel so light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really going to\Ntake your free will away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A clone with free will\Nand a human without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of us has it worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To see, you're perfectly human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when I lose my will,\Nwhat will that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for example, you\Nsay you follow orders now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if the government\Nordered you to kill a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would resist. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This experiment will strip side\Naway your memories as a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and thus your human emotions will no...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,longer exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exam is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're free to go now. Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting to feel anxious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't believe that for an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:10:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll lose your memories and emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can simply accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not when there's someone you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, until this is over, I'll ensure\Nthat you retain some free will, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have roughly a year\Ntill then, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Writing her another letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to send as many as\NI can while I have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell Bonnie I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over the next year, I'm going to write\Ndown a lifetime's worth of feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's\Nabout to turn nine already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.06,0:11:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet she's grown so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know when this letter\Nwill reach you, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But happy ninth birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at Vegapunk's lab now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma, Connie made her special\Ngiant pizza for you! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.22,0:12:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still no letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll come soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my birthday today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, you promised you'd write me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.70,0:13:38.67,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1444,638)}Baltigo, Revolutionary \NArmy Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So kuma saved our forces again. Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in a bad spot\Ntill he bailed us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he left without saying a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.32,0:13:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what he wants,\Nthen fine, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have a reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that he can't tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm killed! See? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the stones are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been a very patient girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can go outside now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to take care of\Nyou until your 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's just what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't trick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk told me I'd be all better in\Na year, and it's been longer than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sick anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.16,0:15:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That nurse is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could she do this to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alpha and her teammates are\Ngovernment intelligence agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.98,0:15:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not a nurse?! But\Nhow can that pass — shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was getting drunk in town the\Nother day and kept running her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out you were right, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told people you were completely cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what she's cooking up,\Nbut it's too fishy for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would she want to keep someone who's\Nperfectly healthy cooped up for six months?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's also strange that you haven't\Ngotten a single letter from Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already talked with\NGyogyo and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make for the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, they'll take you to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can search for your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we'll find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, returning to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna and his friends\Nare no ordinary fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even pirates and sea monsters cower\Nat the mention of their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With them on your side,\NI know you'll find Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The grass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie's actually walking outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.62,0:17:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There really is a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuckoo! Toto! Potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Bonney hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Dowager Connie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you just went out a moment ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.98,0:18:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell you are! Neat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the ship look like pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool me, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And away we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Alpha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the subject tries to escape, then\Nnothing is off the table anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll subdue you by any means necessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll make this so much easier! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a government agent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She uses the six powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't keep going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't kill Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can kill the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad, can you tell\Nme what Nico looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, no one\Nknows for sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DISTORTING Denjiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you! Morley!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they say his body could\Nmove and stretch like rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fought fast and free,\Nflying however he fancied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miserable brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Niko's like future!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie's escape was immediately\Nreported to the World Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she set out with the\Nfishermen in search of her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would soon evolve\Ninto a new era pirate crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rivaling even the Straw Hats in infamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a message. I need a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The voice of my voice is my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm deaf. I'm deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to eat, but\Nthe deep sea is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:22:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day, we're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this door, now I'll give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me go, I'm not the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.26,0:22:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ask the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.16,0:22:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ask the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go beyond the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think that it's one of the\Nmain things. Why don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You

